<h1>Invoice — {{plan}} Plan</h1>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>Thank you for your subscription. Here's your invoice summary:</p>

<div class="highlight">
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#888;">Invoice ID</td>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#e5e5e5;text-align:right;">{{invoiceId}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#888;">Plan</td>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#e5e5e5;text-align:right;">GateML {{plan}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#888;">Amount</td>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#a78bfa;font-weight:700;text-align:right;">{{amount}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#888;">Billing Period</td>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#e5e5e5;text-align:right;">{{periodStart}} – {{periodEnd}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#888;">Date</td>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#e5e5e5;text-align:right;">{{date}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>A PDF copy of your invoice is attached to this email for your records.</p>
<p>You can manage your billing and view past invoices from your dashboard:</p>
<a href="{{billingUrl}}" class="btn">Billing Dashboard</a>
<hr class="divider" />
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#666;">If you have questions about this invoice, reply to this email or contact us through your support dashboard.</p>
